    ‖ratComplexValue (lowZeroCoefficientsP1J1I5K4State 0)-
      complexPowerExpAtom (complexThetaExponent lowZeroSeedP1J1I5K4Point)
        (Real.pi*(4:ℝ)^2) (((27:ℚ)/8):ℂ)‖≤
